  "item.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.vocal_cords": "载光之声弦",
  "block.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.azure_bricks": "天青砖",
  "item.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.sigil_of_the_red_sun_stage_3": "赤阳符印",
  "item.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.sigil_of_the_red_sun_stage_2": "赤阳符印",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.meet.1": "？？？：幸会，",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.meet.2": "莉娜拉：我是莉娜拉，安瑟之子众裔中的一员",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.meet.3": "莉娜拉：你被投入这个世界，自有其使命。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.meet.4": "莉娜拉：你我本是同类。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.meet.5": "莉娜拉：受白焰的恩典引领而来。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.meet.6": "莉娜拉：可惜，我们此次相会只得片刻的垂顾。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.meet.7": "莉娜拉：来，收下这份请柬，把它呈给我主母。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.meet.8": "莉娜拉：她正在神圣高塔中等候你的到来。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.meet.9": "莉娜拉：别过。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower1.1": "莉娜拉：又见面了",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower1.2": "莉娜拉：我目睹了你与无名守门人的战斗",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower1.3": "莉娜拉：干得漂亮",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower1.4": "莉娜拉：然而……",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower1.5": "莉娜拉：风在对我低语。 ",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower1.6": "莉娜拉：他那腐朽的心智仍在玷污这个世界的画布",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower1.7": "莉娜拉：……",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower1.8": "莉娜拉：能替我回一趟誓约脓疮教堂吗？",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower1.9": "莉娜拉：我持有一把宝库的钥匙",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower1.10": "莉娜拉：把「癫狂之眼」带给我",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower1.11": "莉娜拉：余下的宝物便作为你的报酬。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower1.12": "莉娜拉：来，收下这把钥匙",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower1.13": "莉娜拉：我会在此等你归来",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower2.1": "莉娜拉：恳请你原谅我",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower2.2": "莉娜拉：我的目的是探明你对那名为「癫狂」的邪恶诅咒有多强的抵抗力",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower2.3": "莉娜拉：而此刻你安然立于我的面前。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower2.4": "莉娜拉：神智丝毫未损",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower2.5": "莉娜拉：如此坚韧……",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower2.6": "莉娜拉：如此强大……",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower2.7": "莉娜拉：我如今必须走了。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower2.8": "莉娜拉：别处还需要我履行职责。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower2.9": "莉娜拉：愿我们重逢。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower2.10": "莉娜拉：求你……",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower2.11": "莉娜拉：不要放弃……",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.linara.tower2.12": "莉娜拉：我相信你……",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.marlene.good": "玛琳：很好……",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.marlene.as_promised": "玛琳：如我承诺的那样，我会转化你取得的记忆。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.marlene.just_hand_it_over": "玛琳：把它交给我吧。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.marlene.who_art_thou": "玛琳：你是谁？",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.marlene.did_mother_send": "玛琳：是母亲派你来的吗？",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.marlene.ellipsis": "玛琳：……",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.marlene.good_soft": "玛琳：很好……",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.marlene.well": "玛琳：嗯……",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.marlene.sense_memory": "玛琳：我感觉到你手上有一份记忆？",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.marlene.shall_convert": "玛琳：我会转化它，",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.marlene.offer_help": "玛琳：但你得先为我效劳。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.marlene.scholar": "玛琳：我是钻研文字的学者，探寻被遗忘的秘闻。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.marlene.bring_book": "玛琳：带一本书给我，一个我从未读过的故事。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.marlene.return_grant": "玛琳：找到之后回来找我，我便满足你的愿望。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.marlene.head_observatory": "玛琳：你该前往观测台。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.marlene.mother_wishes": "玛琳：母亲想在决斗中试试你的实力。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.marlene.take_this_key": "玛琳：拿好这把钥匙。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.marlene.good_luck": "玛琳：祝你好运……",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.at_last": "萨菲拉：终于，我找到了一个足够坚韧、能直面这世界深处恐怖的人。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.forgive_me": "萨菲拉：原谅我……",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.burden": "萨菲拉：虽然我后悔将这份重担压在你身上，但你要知道，你是终结我们苦难的天选之人。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.well_done": "萨菲拉：干得漂亮，",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.earned_respect": "萨菲拉：你赢得了尊重。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.possess_memory": "萨菲拉：我察觉到，你持有着他的记忆。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.talk_marlene": "萨菲拉：去找玛琳谈谈。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.student_mine": "萨菲拉：她是我的学生，",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.convert_past": "萨菲拉：也是唯一能转化他的过去的人。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.take_keys": "萨菲拉：收下这些钥匙。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.path_room": "萨菲拉：它能打开通往她房间的路。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.second_level": "萨菲拉：她就站在第二层。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.return_to_me": "萨菲拉：完成后回来找我。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.welcome_heart": "萨菲拉：欢迎来到我们宇宙的正中心。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.birthplace": "萨菲拉：也是梅里德与白色烈焰的诞生之地。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.no_hold_back": "萨菲拉：我劝你千万别手下留情。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.let_us_begin": "萨菲拉：那么，开始吧。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.very_well": "萨菲拉：很好。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.stars_align": "萨菲拉：愿群星列阵，化作我们新成员的模样。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.ellipsis": "萨菲拉：……",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.great_potential": "萨菲拉：我察觉到你体内蕴藏着巨大的潜力。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.will_rival": "萨菲拉：还有足以匹敌破碎女神的意志。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.take_this": "萨菲拉：收下这个。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.now_go": "萨菲拉：去吧。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.peril_together": "萨菲拉：前路危机四伏，但只要同心协力，我们定能渡过。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.head_church": "萨菲拉：前往誓约脓疮教堂，击败无名守门人。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.wait_return": "萨菲拉：我会在这里等你回来。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.leader_welcome": "萨菲拉：作为安瑟子民的领袖，我在指引的怀抱中欢迎你。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.hand_invitation": "萨菲拉：把莉娜拉给你的邀请函交给我。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.adopt": "萨菲拉：我便乐意将你纳入我的慈爱照拂之下。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.i_am_saphyra": "萨菲拉：我是萨菲拉，这世上仍存活的少数女巫之一。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.very_well_ellipsis": "萨菲拉：很好……",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.enough_playing": "萨菲拉：别再闹着玩了。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.get_serious": "萨菲拉：来点真的吧。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.hat_found_me": "萨菲拉：看来有人找到我了。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.hat_while": "萨菲拉：好久不见。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.hat_pray_valor": "萨菲拉：我会祈祷你的勇气足以在这场决斗中击败我。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.hat_you_did_it": "萨菲拉：哦，你做到了！",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.hat_ready_fight": "萨菲拉：准备好战斗时，把它交给我。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.hat_believe": "萨菲拉：我相信你。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.saphyra.hat_over_here": "萨菲拉：嘿，你！对，就是你。我在这儿！",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.mystery.clocktower": "？？？：到断裂钟楼来见我。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.mystery.welcome": "？？？：欢迎。",
  "dialogue.mokels_bossfight_saphyra.mystery.linara_informed": "？？？：莉娜拉已告知我你即将到来。",
